 panel.innerHTML='<div class="prep-heading"><div><span class="section-kicker">WORKING INTEGRATION / SYNTHETIC ONLY</span><h2>Scoped edge service credentials</h2><p>Issue an expiring credential for one active synthetic test binding. The bearer endpoint commits synthetic observations without a browser session or user password. Broker transport and measured-device enrollment remain pending.</p></div><button id="svc-refresh" type="button" class="action-outline">Refresh service credentials</button></div><p class="guide-boundary">Administrator password verification is required to issue or revoke. Tokens are shown once, stored hashed on the service and never saved in browser storage. Issuer access/revision changes, binding retirement, expiry and revocation deny ingestion.</p><p id="svc-feedback" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><div class="product-table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Credential / label</th><th>Exact binding</th><th>Effective state</th><th>Expires (service time)</th><th>Action</th></tr></thead><tbody id="svc-rows"></tbody></table></div><details id="svc-create"><summary>Issue a scoped synthetic credential</summary><form id="svc-create-form" class="incident-form"><label>Label<input id="svc-label" required maxlength="80" autocomplete="off"></label><label>Exact test device ID<input id="svc-device" required maxlength="64" pattern="[A-Za-z0-9_-]+" autocomplete="off"></label><label>Binding revision<input id="svc-binding-revision" type="number" required min="1" step="1"></label><label>Lifetime (minutes, 1–1440)<input id="svc-lifetime" type="number" required min="1" max="1440" step="1"></label><label>Reason<textarea id="svc-reason" required minlength="10" maxlength="800"></textarea></label><label>Your administrator password<input id="svc-password" type="password" required maxlength="256" autocomplete="current-password"></label><button id="svc-use-binding" class="action-outline" type="button">Use selected test binding</button><button id="svc-issue" class="quick-primary" type="submit">Issue scoped credential</button></form></details><details><summary>Use the service delivery worker</summary><p>The new one-pass worker uses EDGEOPS_SERVICE_TOKEN from a private environment and an explicit loopback HTTP origin. It sends only to /api/edge/observations and does not log the token. Read SERVICE_IDENTITY.md before use. No supervisor or broker is installed automatically. Never paste tokens into reports, screenshots or source files.</p></details>';
 document.getElementById('page-devices').append(panel);
 const secret=document.createElement('dialog');secret.id='svc-secret-dialog';secret.className='product-dialog';secret.setAttribute('aria-labelledby','svc-secret-title');secret.innerHTML='<div class="product-dialog-head"><h2 id="svc-secret-title">Service credential · shown once</h2></div><p>Keep this credential in a private environment for the one-pass test worker. Closing or navigating away clears it from this page. It cannot be retrieved again; revoke and issue a replacement if lost.</p><label for="svc-secret">Scoped bearer credential</label><textarea id="svc-secret" rows="4" readonly spellcheck="false" autocomplete="off"></textarea><button id="svc-secret-close" class="action-outline" type="button">Close and clear credential</button>';
